(DBAPI rows/s is SQLAlchemy hydration around the read; the read_rows line is the decode this change targets.)

### AB
bench: read_rows median 656.0 -> 633.2 cycles/row, -3.5% (5.79M -> 6.00M rows/s equivalent); mixed: 739.3 -> 748.5 cycles/row, +1.2%. Net: within the host spread, with the bench shape ~3% lower on the decode and the null/varlena shape a wash.
